theme = ExtResource("4_6nclb")
text = "Wellness Check – Parvo Trand
Day 165 of Voyage

Patient entered medbay seeking aid with apparent muscle degradation. Patient felt fatigued and weak. Patient comment upon intake was “I feel like everything is pushing in around me.” Upon regular medical examination, patient does seem to be experiencing acute muscle atrophy. Prescribed patient with 45 minutes of cardio a cycle. Will continue to monitor and follow up if the need arises.
"

