[node name="CarbMonoPoison" type="RichTextLabel" parent="." unique_id=1600088067]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 233.0
offset_top = 180.0
offset_right = 1211.0
offset_bottom = 539.0
theme = ExtResource("4_6nclb")
text = "Wellness Check - Landon Whitlock
Day 502 of Voyage

Patient was rushed into medbay by medical personnel. Patient was reported to have been hallucinating. Bystanders and medical personnel heard patient mumbling about “the Long Burrower in the rock.” Final diagnosis was decided to be carbon monoxide poisoning. Maintenance has been alerted to the issue. We are hoping that the climate control issues that have been arising do not effect anymore of the colonists.
"

